+Godot 4.7.x, Windows Desktop export.
+## v0.7 Native 3D City World
+- Replaced the previous 2D/pseudo-3D city renderer with a real Godot 3D SubViewport world.
+- Perspective Camera3D with wheel zoom, middle-mouse pan, right-mouse orbit, WASD pan, Q/E rotate, Home reset and district focus.
+- Procedural 3D road meshes, bridges, sidewalks, lane markings, crosswalks and traffic lights.
+- 200+ persistent 3D buildings with district-specific height/type variation, windows, rooftops and industrial details.
+- 132 moving 3D vehicles including buses and service vehicles following the road graph.
+- 460 3D citizens walking on sidewalk-offset routes to work, home, shopping and leisure destinations.
+- 3D parks, trees, university field, industrial yard, bus stops, parking lots, construction cranes, river and bank headquarters.
+- Dynamic sun/ambient lighting for a slow day/night cycle while the bank UI remains a native 2D management overlay.
